<header><p class="enc-kicker">Work / monument · song</p><h1 class="enc-title">Wind of Change</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">recorded for Crazy World (<a href="/years/1990">1990</a>); single released 21 January <a href="/years/1991">1991</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/20th-century">20th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">&quot;<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/wind-of-change-speech">Wind of Change</a>&quot; is a power ballad by the German rock band Scorpions, recorded for their 11th studio album, Crazy World (1990). It was written and composed by the band's singer, Klaus Meine, and produced by Keith Olsen with the band.</p></div>
